/T (Analysis reported: Mean one-way delay = 28.4 ms, Mean RFC 3550 Jitter = 4.2 ms, Max Delta = 41.0 ms, Packet Loss = 0.12% \(18 lost packets\), Average Throughput = 84.6 kbps. Comparison with A1.3 Targets: Delay \(28.4 ms < 150 ms\), Jitter \(4.2 ms < 20 ms\), and Loss \(0.12% < 1.0%\) all comfortably meet A1.3 VoIP targets on regional Indian servers, whereas the Europe server in evening hours \(~89.6 ms one-way delay + queuing\) approaches the 150 ms interactive threshold.)
