/Title (Measured Results \(2 Mbps Congested Link\): Under Strict-Priority \(EF\), voice delay stayed at 54.2 ms \(0% loss\) while background download received 1.12 Mbps. Under WFQ \(equal weights across flows\), background download rose to 1.45 Mbps, but bursty TCP packets pushed voice delay to 118 ms and jitter to 19 ms.)
